        "original_id": "a884f5bb-93a6-5a42-ab2a-ff9a75c4f5b2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sunye, Min Sun-ye, Stephen Pearcy, Sohee, Hyuna\n- Groups: Wonder Girls\n- Roles: missionary, singer, actress, musician\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Pearcy was born on July 3, 1956, and he is an American musician.\n- Sunye, whose birth name is Min Sun-ye, was born on August 12, 1989, and she is a South Korean missionary and a former singer and actress on hiatus.\n- Sunye is also known as Sunye or Sun, with SunYe used as a stylized form of her name.\n- Hyuna left Wonder Girls in late 2007.\n- Sunye and Sohee officially left Wonder Girls in 2015.",
